```

### Reproduction cost

> How much would it cost today to reproduce a 2026 robot?

### China substitution ratio

> What percentage of a Western BOM now has viable Chinese substitutes?

### Robot commodity frontier

> Cheapest currently purchasable stack satisfying a fixed autonomous-mobile-robot capability.

### Repairability index

> Expected service cost / useful life across architectures.

### Supply concentration

> Which physical capabilities depend on one/few manufacturers?

### Architecture convergence

> Are new robot builders increasingly using the same motors, controllers or protocols?

### Capability diffusion

> How long after a technology appears in expensive equipment does it reach cheap commodity modules?

These datasets **cannot simply be queried from JLC tomorrow**.

That's the moat.

