And that can be much more valuable than a 10-million-SKU API.

The Chinese manufacturing ecosystem already demonstrates that **design → prototype → assembly → finished machine** is commercially available today; what's fragmented is the knowledge required to reliably choose and connect the right services and components. That's precisely the layer worth planting now. ([One Stop MFG][3])

